* two-item array <code>[</code> <i>key, value</i> <code>]</code>, or
* the hash's default value if the hash is empty.
*
* h = { 1 => "a", 2 => "b", 3 => "c" }
* h.shift #=> [1, "a"]
* h #=> {2=>"b", 3=>"c"}
